{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45048","headline":"贻李汤 · 皎然","name":"贻李汤","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"茅氏常论七真记，壶公爱说三山事。\n宁知梅福在人间，独爲苍生作仙吏。\n日服丹砂骨自清，肤如冰雪心更明。\n山中玉笋是仙药，袖里素书题养生。\n愿随黄鹤一轻举，仰望青霄独延伫。\n平生好骏君已知，何必山阴访王许。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皎然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45048.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45048","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}